OL,3,AItalian PM files to trademark her voice
OL,4,Aagainst AI threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni
OL,7,Fhas applied to trademark her voice in a
OL,8,Fmove to protect herself against
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI) deepfakes.
OL,11,FThe application to the European Union
OL,12,FIntellectual Property Office (EUIPO)
OL,13,Fwas made on Monday and can be found on
OL,14,Ftheir website. The prime minister's
OL,15,Foffice also confirmed the application.
OL,17,FAs part of it, Meloni recorded a
OL,18,Ffour-second audio where she says "Io
OL,19,Fsono Giorgia" - I am Giorgia Meloni" in
OL,20,FItalian - twice.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
